{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\nじょしらく4日目でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/25/0579422/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しかった(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このメンバーで\nこのスタッフさんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このお客様だからできた公演だと\n強く感じた日でした(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\n来てくれてありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n真夏、まいやん、まいちゅんが\n来てくれたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/25/0579422/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんの到着前に撮ったから\n真夏とまいちゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/25/0579422/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームくの3公演目に\n友達が来てくれてたんだけど\nその友達すごい楽しんでくれたみたいだし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2公演目に来てた中田ママも\nまた見たいって言ってたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身内からの声も本当に嬉しいなと思うばかり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nファンの方々からの声\n本当に本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演を1回やる度に\nファンの方の生での反応とか\nあと、コメントとか見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここは変えてみようかなとか\n考えてやってきたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は本当にラストなので\n考えないで空気感を楽しんで\nできたらいいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n4